        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 49</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XCII[I]} Gif mon on his mæstenne unaliefed swin gemete, genime þonne VI sciƚƚ weorð wed.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone finds swine on his pasture without permission, let him then take a pledge-payment of 6 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone finds swine intruding in his mast pasture, he may take security to the value of 6 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon on his mæstene unalyfed swin gemete, genime ðonne VI scll'. weorð wed.</ab>
